// #1907 reverses #1344 at story scope, on the maintainer's instruction: a
// story loop's header ends at its line, so each condition below is story
// and each loop is missing it. In a function (the sibling fixture
// loop-condition-next-line-in-function-1344) the condition still begins
// on the next line.
for
  i = 1, 3
do
  x = i
end
while
  x
do
  x = nil
end
